            <title>[IGNITE-7933] The error writing wal point to cp/node-start file can lead to the inability to start node</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7933</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The problem is that the file exists on the disk but file content corrupted.&lt;br/&gt;
 Need to write content via .tmp files.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;writeCheckpointEntry&lt;/li&gt;
