                            <comment id="16398440" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 14 Mar 2018 11:52:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user Jokser opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/3633&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/3633&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7933&quot; title=&quot;The error writing wal point to cp/node-start file can lead to the inability to start node&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-7933&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-7933&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Checkpoint markers writing issues&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Write checkpoint markers through temporary files&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Stop node if markCheckpointBegin is failed&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Reduced stop timeout&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Use Runtime.halt() to kill JVM if node is not stopped within timeout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;You can merge this pull request into a Git repository by running:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    $ git pull &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/gridgain/apache-ignite&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/gridgain/apache-ignite&lt;/a&gt; ignite-7933&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Alternatively you can review and apply these changes as the patch at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/3633.patch&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/3633.patch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To close this pull request, make a commit to your master/trunk branch&lt;br/&gt;
with (at least) the following in the commit message:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This closes #3633&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;commit c9138c3ea9d6d79141aeedf02c7e27c3e2a487fe&lt;br/&gt;
Author: Pavel Kovalenko &amp;lt;jokserfn@...&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Date:   2018-03-14T11:51:01Z&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7933&quot; title=&quot;The error writing wal point to cp/node-start file can lead to the inability to start node&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-7933&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-7933&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Checkpoint markers writing issues:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Write checkpoint markers through temporary files&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Stop node if markCheckpointBegin is failed&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Reduced stop timeout&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Use Runtime.halt() to kill JVM if node is not stopped within timeout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;hr /&gt;</comment>
