                            <comment id="16422004" author="agoncharuk" created="Mon, 2 Apr 2018 07:56:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Pavel,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1) Use try-with-resources for directory stream, currently close() can be missed&lt;br/&gt;
2) Change &quot;Unable&quot; in error messages to &quot;Failed&quot; - this is consistent with other Ignite error messages, if possible, provide some context on the error happened.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dpavlov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;dpavlov&quot;&gt;dpavlov&lt;/a&gt; Can you please also review these changes?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16422135" author="jokser" created="Mon, 2 Apr 2018 11:09:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agoncharuk&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agoncharuk&quot;&gt;agoncharuk&lt;/a&gt; Review concerns are fixed&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
